         <description>
            <p>
                The repository provides a set of improved Pixinsight scripts from various authors as well as some newly written scripts.
            </p>
            <p>
               Updates:
               <br/>
               Fix a PixInsight crash when closing LocalSupportMask or TGScriptSkeleton with an empty preview. The shared preview control now reliably finishes drawing operations, including when drawing fails. Script interfaces and image-processing behavior remain unchanged.
            </p>
